    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n80989" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">περᾰτ-όω</span></b> , (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πέρας</span>)
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>limit, bound</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Str.
				2.3.1
			</span></i>,al.; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">νύκτα καὶ ἡμέραν ἀνατολαῖς καὶ
					δύσεσιν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ph.
					1.347
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">π. τὴν ὕλην ἄπειρον οὖσαν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plu.
					2.719d
