				Pass.
			, <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>de An.</u>
				407a28
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Mu.</u>
				391b15
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				2.389f
			</span></i>; <i>to be terminated, finished off</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Aret.
				<u>SD</u>
				1.7
			</span></i> (dub. cj.), <i><span class="en">
				Gal.
				18(2).766
			</span></i>. </div>
